        "html": "<section class=\"pp-section pp-section--sm\" style=\"padding-top: 0;\">\n      <div class=\"pp-container\">\n        <div class=\"pp-grid pp-grid--2\" style=\"gap: var(--pp-space-12); align-items: start;\">\n\n          <div>\n            <span class=\"pp-eyebrow\">Grooming & Care · 10 g</span>\n            <h1 style=\"margin-bottom: var(--pp-space-2);\">Pet Paw Moisturizing Gel</h1>\n                        <p class=\"pp-lead\">Restores pad elasticity, prevents cracking</p>\n\n            <div class=\"pp-trust-row\" style=\"margin-bottom: var(--pp-space-6);\">\n              <span class=\"pp-badge pp-badge--amber\">MOQ 1,000</span>\n              <span class=\"pp-badge\">Sample on request</span>\n              <span class=\"pp-badge\">Quote in 1 business day</span>\n            </div>\n\n            \n            <div style=\"aspect-ratio: 1; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff, #f8fafc); border-radius: var(--pp-radius-xl); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border: 1px solid var(--pp-ink-200); overflow: hidden;\">\n              <img src=\"/assets/img/products/pet-paw-moisturizing-gel.png?v=2\" alt=\"Pet Paw Moisturizing Gel\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; padding: var(--pp-space-4);\" onerror=\"this.parentElement.innerHTML='<div style=&quot;font-size: 6rem; color: var(--pp-teal-300);&quot;>🐾</div>'\">\n            </div>\n            <p style=\"font-size: var(--pp-text-xs); color: var(--pp-ink-500); margin-top: var(--pp-space-2); text-align: center;\">DEKOBIO · 10 g</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div>\n                        <div class=\"pp-card\" style=\"margin-bottom: var(--pp-space-4);\">\n\n\n              <h3 data-i18n=\"products.keyFeatures\" style=\"margin-bottom: var(--pp-space-2);\">Self-designed for cracked paw pads</h3>\n\n\n              <ul style=\"list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; font-size: var(--pp-text-sm);\">\n\n\n                <li style=\"margin-bottom: var(--pp-space-1);\"><strong style=\"color: var(--pp-teal-700);\">Multi-oil blend</strong> &#8212; 4 carrier oils (grape + olive + argan + avocado) penetrate rough paw-pad skin.</li>\n\n                <li style=\"margin-bottom: var(--pp-space-1);\"><strong style=\"color: var(--pp-teal-700);\">Barrier-forming dimethicone</strong> &#8212; seals moisture in for 6&#8211;8 hours.</li>\n\n                <li style=\"margin-bottom: var(--pp-space-1);\"><strong style=\"color: var(--pp-teal-700);\">Vitamin E + ginseng</strong> &#8212; antioxidant + circulation support for healing cracked pads.</li>\n\n                <li style=\"margin-bottom: 0;\"><strong style=\"color: var(--pp-teal-700);\">Non-greasy finish</strong> &#8212; absorbs in 2 minutes, pet can walk on floors without slipping.</li>\n\n\n              </ul>\n\n\n            </div>\n\n\n            <div class=\"pp-card\" style=\"margin-bottom: var(--pp-space-4);\">\n\n\n              <h3 data-i18n=\"products.ingredients\" style=\"margin-bottom: var(--pp-space-2);\">Main ingredients &#8212; and what each one powers</h3>\n\n\n              <table style=\"width:100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: var(--pp-text-sm);\">\n\n\n                <tbody>\n\n\n                  <tr style=\" border-bottom: 1px solid var(--pp-ink-100);\">\n\n\n\n                    <td style=\"padding: 6px 6px 6px 0; font-weight: 600; color: var(--pp-teal-700); vertical-align: top; white-space: nowrap;\">Grape Seed Oil</td>\n\n\n\n                    <td style=\"padding: 6px 0; color: var(--pp-ink-700); vertical-align: top;\">Light penetrating oil &#8212; first layer.</td>\n\n\n\n                  <tr style=\" border-bottom: 1px solid var(--pp-ink-100);\">\n\n\n\n                    <td style=\"padding: 6px 6px 6px 0; font-weight: 600; color: var(--pp-teal-700); vertical-align: top; white-space: nowrap;\">Olive Oil</td>\n\n\n\n                    <td style=\"padding: 6px 0; color: var(--pp-ink-700); vertical-align: top;\">Deep moisturization &#8212; second layer.</td>\n\n\n\n                  <tr style=\" border-bottom: 1px solid var(--pp-ink-100);\">\n\n\n\n                    <td style=\"padding: 6px 6px 6px 0; font-weight: 600; color: var(--pp-teal-700); vertical-align: top; white-space: nowrap;\">Argan Kernel Oil</td>\n\n\n\n                    <td style=\"padding: 6px 0; color: var(--pp-ink-700); vertical-align: top;\">Repair cracked pads &#8212; active treatment.</td>\n\n\n\n                  <tr style=\" border-bottom: 1px solid var(--pp-ink-100);\">\n\n\n\n                    <td style=\"padding: 6px 6px 6px 0; font-weight: 600; color: var(--pp-teal-700); vertical-align: top; white-space: nowrap;\">Dimethicone</td>\n\n\n\n                    <td style=\"padding: 6px 0; color: var(--pp-ink-700); vertical-align: top;\">Moisture-seal barrier &#8212; 6&#8211;8 h hold.</td>\n\n\n\n                  <tr style=\" border-bottom: 1px solid var(--pp-ink-100);\">\n\n\n\n                    <td style=\"padding: 6px 6px 6px 0; font-weight: 600; color: var(--pp-teal-700); vertical-align: top; white-space: nowrap;\">Vitamin E</td>\n\n\n\n                    <td style=\"padding: 6px 0; color: var(--pp-ink-700); vertical-align: top;\">Antioxidant + healing &#8212; long-term support.</td>\n\n\n\n                  <tr style=\"\">\n\n\n\n                    <td style=\"padding: 6px 6px 6px 0; font-weight: 600; color: var(--pp-teal-700); vertical-align: top; white-space: nowrap;\">Ginseng Root Extract</td>\n\n\n\n                    <td style=\"padding: 6px 0; color: var(--pp-ink-700); vertical-align: top;\">Circulation support &#8212; recovery.</td>\n\n\n\n\n                </tbody>\n\n\n              </table>\n\n\n            </div>\n\n\n\n\n            <div class=\"pp-card\">\n\n\n              <h3 data-i18n=\"products.labReports\" style=\"margin-bottom: var(--pp-space-2);\">Third-party lab reports</h3>\n\n\n              <p style=\"color: var(--pp-ink-500); font-size: var(--pp-text-sm); margin: 0;\">No specific lab report required. Manufactured under factory-level QC (ISO 22716); full COA available on request.</p>\n\n\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>"
